<title>UK: Sueddeutsche Bodencredit sets 100 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Sueddeutsche Bodencredit sets 100 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDDEUTSCHE BODENCREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *3.75	MATURITY    24.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  S-23.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING    MUNICH    DENOMS (K) ONE	 S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 24.JUL.97 THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR STEPS-UP TO</p>
<p>		4.40 PCT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
